which are completely real. If AI had no positive

01:04:09.200 --> 01:04:15.280
potential, nobody would develop it. And the 
positive potential is enormous again in transport,

01:04:15.280 --> 01:04:22.000
medicine, education, in so many fields. So again, 
I'm not saying stop all development of AI. Yes,

01:04:22.000 --> 01:04:33.280
develop it, but in a safe way and uh a bit more 
slowly. So we enable uh democratic accountability

01:04:33.280 --> 01:04:40.800
to take place. It takes time and we enable 
people to adjust and make informed decisions

01:04:40.800 --> 01:04:47.360
about which way they want to go. And for them, 
the most important narrative to combat is the

01:04:47.360 --> 01:04:53.840
narrative of inevitability. You wrote in in 
Nexus, I was very struck by this passage in

01:04:53.840 --> 01:04:59.360
in the prologue. You said, "Why are we so good 
at accumulating more information and power,

01:04:59.360 --> 01:05:06.480
but far less successful at acquiring wisdom?" 
And I read that um and I came to mind as I've

01:05:06.480 --> 01:05:13.440
just been digesting what you've just told me. It 
suggests to me that if I if I asked you to put a

01:05:13.440 --> 01:05:19.360
probability on us having the wisdom to navigate 
this, it would be quite low. I don't know. But

01:05:19.360 --> 01:05:27.360
there is a fair chance. Why? Because we are up 
against the wall. Humans often do the wrong things

01:05:27.360 --> 01:05:35.280
until they have no choice but to do the right 
thing. And we are in bad position because if we

01:05:35.280 --> 01:05:42.560
choose unwisely in the next few years, we could 
lose all control of the world and of the future.

01:05:42.560 --> 01:05:47.600
And that's the last choice we make. So it's like 
we had a genie in the battle. It gave us a 100

01:05:47.600 --> 01:05:54.400
wishes. We used 99 of them. The world is not in 
such a good shape. We have one last wish left.

01:05:54.400 --> 01:06:05.760
we need to think really hard what to use this wish 
for and that's wisdom. So AI in a way could be

01:06:05.760 --> 01:06:12.080
uh uh the catalyst so for some kind of uh you 
know spiritual revolution of humanity simply

01:06:12.080 --> 01:06:18.880
because it forces us to think really hard what 
does it mean to be human? What is the value of

01:06:18.880 --> 01:06:25.280
being human? and the superficial answers that we 
gave for thousands of years. Oh, humanity is about

01:06:25.280 --> 01:06:31.200
intelligence. We know how to play chess and how 
to invest money better than the chimpanzees. So,

01:06:31.200 --> 01:06:36.880
this is what makes us so special. This answer 
is now irrelevant because there is something on

01:06:36.880 --> 01:06:45.760
the planet that knows how to uh uh uh play chess 
and make money better than us. So, dig deeper and

01:06:45.760 --> 01:06:52.720
try to find out. So, who are you really? If it's 
not about playing chess and making money, I think

01:06:52.720 --> 01:07:00.080
that's a place to end on. AI is our last, we are 
our last chance, but it could be it could be the

01:07:00.080 --> 01:07:06.800
thing that forces us to make enables us to make 
wise choices. Uh, I'm pretty sure that the world

01:07:06.800 --> 01:07:14.160
has a lot more wisdom thanks to your writers. So, 
Uval, thank you so much for joining us. Thank you.

